# Go paths excluded from the 100% coverage gate, one regex per line, matched against
# the package path. Adding a line requires an ADR (docs/build/03-testing.md §2).
# Generated code: sqlc, oapi-codegen and mockgen output.
\.sql\.go$
\.gen\.go$
/mock_[^/]*\.go$
# Composition roots, covered by the e2e start-up smoke test instead.
/cmd/[^/]+/main\.go$
